  "structure": "precast_continuous",
  "review_status": "decision-level answers reviewed by two bridge engineers",
  "input": {
    "structured_en": "[Span arrangement] One continuous unit of ten spans, 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 m (centre-to-centre of bearings), precast girders simply supported during erection and made continuous afterwards; deck width 12.5 m.\n[Section and material] Precast prestressed small box girders, 4 per span; middle-girder section at midspan: depth 1.4 m; top width 2.40 m; flange 0.18 m thick at the tip, thickening by 6.2 cm over a 20.1 cm long haunch next to the web; bottom slab 1.00 m wide and 0.18 m thick; top slab 0.18 m thick; webs 0.20 m thick (measured horizontally) with outer faces inclined at 1:3.5; 15 cm x 7 cm chamfers at the upper corners of the cell; girder concrete C50. Consider the self-weight of the main girders only (no wet joints, diaphragms, pavement or barriers).\n[Bearings and boundary] Abutment 0, Pier 1, Pier 2, Pier 3, Pier 4, Pier 7, Pier 8, Pier 9 and Abutment 10: PTFE sliding laminated elastomeric bearings, two under each girder end; effective plan size 300 mm x 350 mm, four internal rubber layers 8 mm thick. Pier 5 and Pier 6: plain laminated elastomeric bearings (fixed), two under each girder end; effective plan size 300 mm x 350 mm, four internal rubber layers 8 mm thick.\n[Design standard] Highway Class I loading (JTG D60-2015); one-way traffic, carriageway width 11.5 m, three design lanes.",
    "structured_zh": "【跨径布置】一联十跨，跨径 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 + 25 m（支座中心线间距），先简支后连续；桥面全宽 12.5 m。\n【截面与材料】预制预应力混凝土小箱梁，每跨 4 片；中梁跨中截面：梁高 1.4 m；顶宽 2.40 m；翼缘端部厚 0.18 m，近腹板处经 20.1 cm 长加腋增厚 6.2 cm；底板宽 1.00 m、厚 0.18 m；顶板厚 0.18 m；腹板水平厚 0.20 m，外侧坡度 1:3.5；箱内顶角设 15 cm × 7 cm 倒角；主梁混凝土 C50。只计主梁自重（不计湿接缝、横隔板、铺装与护栏）。\n【支座与边界】0 号台、1 号墩、2 号墩、3 号墩、4 号墩、7 号墩、8 号墩、9 号墩、10 号台：四氟滑板式板式橡胶支座，每个梁端 2 个；有效平面尺寸 300 mm × 350 mm，中间橡胶层 4 层、每层厚 8 mm。5 号墩、6 号墩：普通板式橡胶支座（固定），每个梁端 2 个；有效平面尺寸 300 mm × 350 mm，中间橡胶层 4 层、每层厚 8 mm。\n【设计标准】公路-I 级（JTG D60-2015）；单向行驶，行车道宽 11.5 m，设计车道数 3。"
  },
